# "Play Veselin Marinov" media (design/music/*) - Stefan drops files here locally; only a small
# curated subset is tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes) to stay under the free 1GB LFS quota.
# Ignore everything in these folders EXCEPT the tracked subset, which git add stages explicitly.
design/music/songs-audio/*
design/music/concerts-audio/*
design/music/concerts-video/*
!design/music/*/.gitkeep

